## The Mandate

Adevar Inc. is not offering a traditional administrative internship. We are currently in a high-velocity sprint to digitize the first 1,000 restaurants across Nigeria and Vietnam using **anra**—our $15/month QR-powered operating system—and **CasperID**, our biometric identity layer.

We are seeking a Growth Hacker Intern (The Fixer) to serve as the operational backbone of our distribution engine. You will be responsible for funnel mechanics, resolving technical friction, and maintaining the momentum of our global sales force. At Adevar, interns are treated as full-time owners with the mandate to move at breakneck speed.

### The Mission: Funnel Optimization & Distribution

While our Sales Leads and Affiliate Representatives focus on market acquisition, your objective is to ensure the underlying infrastructure remains seamless. You will manage the complexities of onboarding, merchant retention, and community engagement.

## Key Responsibilities (The Trenches)

- **Funnel Orchestration**: Manage the Affiliate WhatsApp communities and internal dashboards. You will vet incoming leads, resolve technical inquiries from field reps, and ensure high engagement within our sales groups.
- **Frictionless Onboarding**: Proactively resolve merchant bottlenecks. If a payment integration via Providus Bank stalls or a digital menu remains incomplete, you are expected to intervene directly and finalize the setup.
- **Strategic Lead Generation**: Execute aggressive data scraping and lead-sourcing. You will identify and compile verified contact lists of high-volume merchants across Lagos and Hanoi for immediate sales outreach.
- **Churn Mitigation**: Monitor merchant activity via the CasperOS dashboard. You will proactively contact any merchant showing signs of inactivity to ensure continued platform adoption and subscription renewal.

## Candidate Profile

- **High Agency**: You possess the "Figure It Out" mentality. You prioritize functional solutions over theoretical perfection and thrive in high-pressure environments.
- **Zero Communication Friction**: You are comfortable engaging with diverse stakeholders—from restaurant owners and waitstaff to aggressive sales professionals—maintaining an authoritative and helpful tone.
- **Technical Resourcefulness**: While production coding is not required, you must be proficient in Zapier, Google Sheets (advanced formulas), web scraping tools, and CRM management.
- **Operational Velocity**: You understand that a functional solution delivered today is superior to a perfect solution delivered next week.

## Compensation & Professional Upside

We believe in performance-driven rewards. Unpaid labor has no place in a high-growth environment.

- **Monthly Stipend**: A flat retainer to cover data, transport, and operational costs.
- **Performance Credits**: Cash bonuses for successful churn rescues or assisting Affiliates in closing high-value deals.
- **Executive Access**: You will work directly with the Founder and the Founding Sales Lead. High performers will be fast-tracked for full-time roles upon completion of the fellowship.

## How to Apply
**Verification**: Navigate to the CasperID portal and ensure your professional profile and resume are securely uploaded.

**Submission**: Click the "Apply" button via the job details page, we will get back to you in 3 working days.

**Bonus Point [Optional ]**:Send an email to **careers@casperid.com** with the subject line: **"Growth Hacker: [Your Name]"**.

- **The Value Proposition**: A concise, two-sentence summary of the anra $15/month value proposition.
- **The Scrape**: List three specific software tools or methodologies you would use to compile a verified list of 500 independent restaurant owners in Lagos or Hanoi within 24 hours.
- **The Rescue**: A merchant messages: "The QR system is too complex for my staff; please cancel my subscription." Provide the exact 3-sentence script you would use on a phone call to retain this client.
- **The Proof**: A link to your CasperID &/or a side project (successful or otherwise) that demonstrates your "builder" mentality.

**Adevar Inc: Move Fast. Scale Hard. Own the Future.**
